      "review_description": "Excellent service from Unplugged Energy. All my questions were answered very promptly, and they provided recommendations based on exactly what I was looking for. I especially appreciated that they even offered cheaper alternatives that would still meet my needs.The installation was exceptional. The unit looks fantastic, and the entire work area was left spotless, thanks Justin, Dylan and Matt. Justin walked me through the system's operation, showed me the switchboard, and even asked me which parts of the house I wanted connected to the backup battery in case of a power outage.All in all, this was a fantastic experience, and I highly recommend Unplugged Energy.",
