      "review_description": "I recently had Unpugged Energy quoted and install a solar battery, rewire my old circuit board, replace the inverter, and test the entire system - and I couldn’t be happier! My house had an outdated electrical setup, requiring them to rearrange and upgrade everything, but JT, Tuong, and Nick handled it with expertise and patience.They were hands-on, professional, and friendly, answering all my questions thoroughly. Despite working in cold, windy conditions, they never cut corners and even went above and beyond by fixing a tile leakage on my roof and giving a gutter clean - something I truly appreciate!Big credit to this hardworking, skilled team—they made the entire process smooth and stress-free. Highly recommended for anyone needing solar or electrical work. Thanks again, Nick, Tuong and JT!",
